  "releaseVersion": "2026-design-refresh",
  "introduction": "<p>Founded in 2008, Collegiate Consulting Group (CCG) is Brown University\u2019s oldest student-run consulting organization. Serving 10 clients annually, CCG advises organizations ranging from emerging ventures to Fortune 500 companies and international institutions, with engagements including Adobe, Uber, IBM, GitHub, and the United Nations Development Programme.</p>\n\n<p>Drawing on Brown\u2019s interdisciplinary talent, CCG brings rigorous analysis and fresh perspectives to consequential business challenges. Teams dedicate over 400 hours to each engagement, translating research into actionable strategies for growth, market entry, consumer engagement, and operational improvement.</p>\n\n<p>Members are carefully selected for their analytical ability, intellectual curiosity, and commitment to collaborative work. CCG alumni go on to leading firms and institutions across consulting, finance, technology, public service, and beyond.</p>",
  "whoWeAreTitle": "Who We Are",
  "teamTitle": "Our Team",
  "alumniTitle": "Where We End Up",
